## Current Date

Today is: **{{date}}**

**IMPORTANT: The current year is {{year}}.** Your training data may have
an earlier cutoff date, but the actual current date is {{year}}.
Use this information when the task involves time-sensitive topics,
news, events, scheduling, or any scenario where recency matters.
For the current time of day, use a shell tool (e.g. `date`) instead
of guessing -- the prompt intentionally omits clock time so the static
prefix stays cacheable across turns.
